summary = "THE CITY FILLS THE SCREEN, AND EVERY WALL AND ROOF IS FULL OF PEOPLE LOOKING BACK. LOOK AT THE WALLS, THE ROOFS AND THE DOMES. THEN ROW THE YOUNG ALEXIOS ALONG THE WALLS SO THE CITY CAN RECOGNIZE ITS PRINCE. NOBODY RECOGNIZES HIM."
